{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57216","headline":"谶 五 · 菩提达摩","name":"谶 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"尊胜今藏古，（尊胜者，妙智也。\n古者，可大师，本有妙高之性，性被烦恼覆之，未现了，故言藏也。\n）无肱亦（《天圣广灯录》作「又」）有肱。\n（肱者，手也，可大师求法断臂也。\n）龙来方受（《天圣广灯录》作「授」）宝，（龙来者，初祖西来也。\n方受宝者，二传法。\n）捧物复（《天圣广灯录》作「奉物伏」）嫌名。\n（捧者，惠也。\n本名神光，复过达摩，嫌之，改名言爲惠可。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"菩提达摩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57216.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57216","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}